    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hop on your <strong>hoverbike</strong> and go guns blazing in this story-driven single-player experience! This <strong>is Retronika and it\u2019s time to fight back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through <strong>chaotic traffic and vibrant cityscapes,</strong> face off against towering metallic bosses, and drones, and prove who\u2019s truly in charge in <strong>Retronika</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Expect Chaotic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in high-speed battles, taking down drones and enemy vehicles as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.poster.avif?t=1744110388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.webm?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.mp4?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Master Your Hoverbike Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of your hoverbike while fighting through and <strong>master your movement to survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.poster.avif?t=1744110388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.webm?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.mp4?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Unravel the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into Planet Retronika, a once-friendly world that has now turned <strong>hostile</strong>, and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.poster.avif?t=1744110388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.webm?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.mp4?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Upgrade. Customize. Dominate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the most out of your hoverbike with <strong>powerful upgrades</strong> and <strong>personalize it</strong> with different customizations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.poster.avif?t=1744110388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.webm?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.mp4?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hop on your <strong>hoverbike</strong> and go guns blazing in this story-driven single-player experience! This <strong>is Retronika and it\u2019s time to fight back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through <strong>chaotic traffic and vibrant cityscapes,</strong> face off against towering metallic bosses, and drones, and prove who\u2019s truly in charge in <strong>Retronika</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Expect Chaotic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in high-speed battles, taking down drones and enemy vehicles as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.poster.avif?t=1744110388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.webm?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.mp4?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Master Your Hoverbike Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of your hoverbike while fighting through and <strong>master your movement to survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.poster.avif?t=1744110388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.webm?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.mp4?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Unravel the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into Planet Retronika, a once-friendly world that has now turned <strong>hostile</strong>, and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.poster.avif?t=1744110388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.webm?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.mp4?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Upgrade. Customize. Dominate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the most out of your hoverbike with <strong>powerful upgrades</strong> and <strong>personalize it</strong> with different customizations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.poster.avif?t=1744110388\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.webm?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.mp4?t=1744110388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Hop on your hoverbike and dive into Retronika, an immersive VR adventure! Fight challenging enemies, master 3D movement and shooting, and navigate vibrant cityscapes. Upgrade your bike, combine weapons, and tackle chaotic missions in this action-packed, story-driven single-player experience!",
